      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode ends with the patient having completed the injection, understanding the next steps (fasting blood draw, endocrine review, nasal endoscopy), and acknowledging red-flag symptoms. The plan is specific, assigned to the endocrine team, and includes timing and materials.",
